description:
This Scheme will cover the Surface Dressing of highways on:
•	Bolton Road, Edgworth;
•	Bury Road, Edgworth;
•	East Park Road, Blackburn;
•	Heys Lane, Blackburn;
•	Livesey Branch Road, Blackburn;
•	Long Lane, Blackburn;
•	Shadsworth Road; Blackburn;
•	Stones Bank Road; West Pennine

And will encompass the following works:
•	Acting as Principal Contractor;
•	Traffic Management;
•	Pre-Patching;
•	Road Stud Removal;
•	Adjustment and/or replacement of ironwork;
•	Application of Surface Dressing or approved material;
•	Replacement of road markings;
•	Replacement of Road Studs;
•	Liaison with stakeholders and the public;
